<template>
  <main class="content-page solar-page"><header class="solar-heading"><p class="section-kicker">SPACE / SOLAR ATLAS</p><h1>抬头之后，<br><span>还有八个世界。</span></h1><p>一个可以转动、靠近与停留的太阳系。原创建模，浅色图谱。</p></header>
    <div class="solar-toolbar"><button class="button button-primary" type="button" :disabled="Boolean(error)" :aria-pressed="playing" @click="toggle">{{ playing ? '暂停运行' : '播放示意轨道' }}</button><label>展示速度<select v-model.number="speed"><option :value=".25">0.25 ×</option><option :value="1">1 ×</option><option :value="4">4 ×</option></select></label><label>观察视角<select v-model="viewMode" :disabled="Boolean(error)"><option value="perspective">立体观察</option><option value="top">北向俯视</option></select></label><label><input v-model="labels" type="checkbox" /> 行星名称</label><label><input v-model="orbits" type="checkbox" /> 示意轨道</label><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" :disabled="Boolean(error)" @click="overview">回到全景</button></div>
    <div class="solar-scrubber"><label for="solar-time">示意时间 <output for="solar-time">{{ Math.floor(time) }} / 600</output></label><input id="solar-time" type="range" min="0" max="600" step="1" :value="time" :disabled="Boolean(error)" @input="scrub($event.target.value)" /><button type="button" :disabled="Boolean(error)" @click="scrub(0)">回到起点</button><small>拖动暂停运行；数字是演示进度，不对应真实日期。</small></div>
    <section class="solar-layout"><div ref="stage" class="solar-stage" :class="{ 'is-expanded': expanded }" :data-playing="playing" :data-time="time.toFixed(2)" :data-view="viewMode" :data-follow="following ? selectedId : ''" :data-orbits="orbits"><div ref="mount" class="solar-canvas" /><p v-if="error" class="solar-error" role="status">{{ error }}</p><button class="solar-expand" type="button" :aria-pressed="expanded" @click="toggleScene">{{ expanded ? '收起图谱' : '放大图谱' }}</button><div class="solar-inset-controls"><button type="button" :disabled="Boolean(error)" @click="toggle">{{ playing ? '暂停运行' : '播放示意轨道' }}</button><button type="button" :disabled="Boolean(error)" @click="overview">回到全景</button></div><span class="solar-stage-note">{{ following ? `跟随${selected.name} · ` : '' }}拖动旋转 · 滚轮 / 双指缩放 · 点击行星</span></div><aside class="solar-information"><p class="section-kicker">{{ selected.english.toUpperCase() }} / 0{{ selected.order }}</p><div class="solar-planet-preview" :style="{ '--planet-color': selected.color }" :class="selected.id"><span /></div><h2>{{ selected.name }}</h2><p class="solar-type">{{ selected.type }} · 太阳向外第 {{ selected.order }} 颗</p><p>{{ selected.note }}</p><button class="text-button" type="button" :disabled="Boolean(error)" @click="closeUp">暂停并靠近它 ↗</button><button class="text-button" type="button" :disabled="Boolean(error)" :aria-pressed="following" @click="followPlanet">{{ following ? '停止跟随，回到全景' : '跟随这颗行星观察 ↗' }}</button><a :href="NASA_SOURCE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NASA 原始资料 ↗</a><small>模型和表面纹理为艺术化示意，不是实拍或地理地图；公转使用圆形轨道。大小、距离、速度均经独立压缩，不用于天体位置或日期预测。</small></aside></section>
    <nav class="solar-planet-list" aria-label="选择行星（无需操作 3D 场景）"><button v-for="planet in PLANETS" :key="planet.id" type="button" :aria-pressed="selected.id === planet.id" :data-mission-target="mission?.targets.includes(planet.id) || false" @click="select(planet.id)"><span :style="{ background: planet.color }" /><strong>{{ planet.name }}</strong><small>{{ planet.english }}</small></button></nav>
    <section class="mission-archive" aria-labelledby="mission-heading"><header><p class="section-kicker">HUMAN JOURNEYS / A LAUNCH ARCHIVE</p><h2 id="mission-heading">我们，曾这样出发。</h2><p>{{ MISSIONS.length }} 段探索故事，按发射时间排列。选择任务可标出相关行星；蓝色轨道只是目标提示，不是航天器航线。</p></header>
      <form class="mission-filters" @submit.prevent><label>寻找任务<input v-model="missionQuery" type="search" maxlength="80" placeholder="旅行者、火星、Juno…" /></label><label>目标行星<select v-model="missionPlanet"><option value="">全部目标</option><option v-for="planet in PLANETS" :key="planet.id" :value="planet.id">{{ planet.name }}</option></select></label><label>发射年代<select v-model="era"><option value="">全部年代</option><option value="classic">2000 年以前</option><option value="modern">2000 年及以后</option></select></label><button class="text-button" type="button" @click="missionPlanet = selectedId; missionQuery = ''; era = ''">查看{{ selected.name }}的任务 ↗</button><button class="text-button" type="button" @click="missionPlanet = ''; missionQuery = ''; era = ''">清空筛选</button></form>
      <div class="mission-layout"><div class="mission-timeline"><p class="mission-count" aria-live="polite">{{ missions.length }} / {{ MISSIONS.length }} 个任务 · 发射日期 UTC</p><p v-if="!missions.length" class="state-text">档案中暂时没有符合条件的任务，并不代表这颗行星从未被探索。</p><button v-for="item in missions" :key="item.id" class="mission-card" type="button" :aria-pressed="mission?.id === item.id" @click="selectMission(item.id)"><time :datetime="item.launch">{{ item.launch }}</time><span><strong>{{ item.name }}</strong><small>{{ item.english }} · {{ item.kind }}</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
        <aside v-if="mission" class="mission-detail" :data-mission="mission.id"><p class="section-kicker">MISSION FILE / {{ mission.launch.slice(0, 4) }}</p><h3>{{ mission.name }}</h3><p class="mission-english">{{ mission.english }} · {{ mission.kind }}</p><p>{{ mission.note }}</p><p>发射日期 <time :datetime="mission.launch">{{ mission.launch }}</time>（UTC）</p><div class="mission-targets"><button v-for="id in mission.targets" :key="id" type="button" @click="focusMissionTarget(id)">靠近{{ PLANETS.find(p => p.id === id).name }} ↗</button></div><p class="mission-note">相关行星按钮和示意轨道已标记。列表筛选不会关闭当前档案；任务按主要探测对象标记，不列全部引力助推点。</p><a :href="mission.source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">核对 NASA 任务资料 ↗</a><a :href="`/solar-system?planet=${selectedId}&mission=${mission.id}`">打开可分享的任务链接 ↗</a><button class="text-button" type="button" @click="selectMission('')">关闭任务标记</button></aside>
        <aside v-else class="mission-detail mission-placeholder"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><h3>下一站，由你选择。</h3><p>点开左侧任务，查看它的目的地、发射日期和原始资料。无需登录，也无需操作 3D 场景。</p></aside></div>
      <p class="mission-note">历史档案核对于 2026-10-05，每个任务附 NASA 原始链接。不是完整航天史，不提供实时位置、任务当前状态或星历预测。</p>
    </section>
    <section class="solar-context"><h2>这是图谱，不是星历。</h2><p>八颗行星按距太阳的顺序排列。前四颗是类地行星；木星和土星为气态巨行星，天王星和海王星为冰巨行星。图谱不模拟卫星、偏心轨道、真实自转或当前天象。</p><p>尊重“减少动态效果”设置：初始静止，由你决定是否播放。切换标签页会停止动画，返回后需手动播放。触摸画布会操作相机，画布外仍可正常滚动页面。</p><p>交互灵感来自 <a href="https://solar-system-atlas.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Solar System Atlas</a>，本站未复制其代码、贴图或音效。知识核对：<a :href="NASA_SOURCE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NASA · About the Planets</a>（2026-10-05）。</p></section>
  </main>
